            "description_html": "<a name=\"LAU-CONTEMPO-SN\"><b>Laurey Contempo Satin Nickel Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in 3 sizes, the Satin Nickel Contempo Cabinet Pull is good for modern kitchens. The Satin Nickel finish is extremely popular in the home decor world right now. The Contempo Satin Nickel Cabinet Pull comes packaged with the mounting hardware. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Laurey Contempo Satin Nickel Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Zinc</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Satin Nickel</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with 1\" long #8-32 screws and 1-1/2\"  long #8-32 screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>LAU-55728:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 5-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LAU-55828:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 6-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LAU-54528:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 7-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
